{"id":"bdce6096efa4097a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dep-exists-11.md","title":"df-dependent-exists-set-model","display":"df-dependent-exists-set-model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-dep-exists-11","aliases":["16-df-dep-exists-11"],"display":"df-dependent-exists-set-model","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-existential-quantifier]]","[[16-df-dep-exists]]"],"source":"Definition 9.3.5 and Example 9.3.6; set predicate instance, cf. §11.2 pp.654–655 (PDF674–675)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dep-exists-11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dep-exists-11</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-exists-set-model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f2931643da418a6\" href=\"?note=1f2931643da418a6\" title=\"16-df-existential-quantifier\">16-df-existential-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ae97efa23f80edf\" href=\"?note=3ae97efa23f80edf\" title=\"16-df-dep-exists\">16-df-dep-exists</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 9.3.5 and Example 9.3.6; set predicate instance, cf. §11.2 pp.654–655 (PDF674–675)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的宇宙，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为小集合族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A\">\\(\\pi_A\\)</span> 由下文构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\Gamma.A\">\\(P\\subseteq\\Gamma.A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>各幂集取包含序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}:\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.A)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}:\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.A)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f2931643da418a6\" href=\"?note=1f2931643da418a6\" title=\"16-df-existential-quantifier\">16-df-existential-quantifier</a> 沿下文投影的直接像；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A^*\">\\(\\pi_A^*\\)</span> 是其逆像。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_A&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\pi_A^*(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\in\\Gamma.A\\mid\\gamma\\in Q\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}(P)&amp;=\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\mid(\\exists a\\in A(\\gamma))\\ (\\gamma,a)\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}(P)\\subseteq Q&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow P\\subseteq\\pi_A^*(Q),\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}&amp;\\dashv\\pi_A^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_A&amp;\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\pi_A^*(Q)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\in\\Gamma.A\\mid\\gamma\\in Q\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}(P)&amp;=\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\mid(\\exists a\\in A(\\gamma))\\ (\\gamma,a)\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}(P)\\subseteq Q&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow P\\subseteq\\pi_A^*(Q),\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}&amp;\\dashv\\pi_A^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接像包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma,a)\\in P\">\\((\\gamma,a)\\in P\\)</span> 的第一分量属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\pi_A^{-1}[Q]\">\\(P\\subseteq\\pi_A^{-1}[Q]\\)</span>。这给出完整的幂集偏序伴随。</p>\n<p>这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ae97efa23f80edf\" href=\"?note=3ae97efa23f80edf\" title=\"16-df-dep-exists\">16-df-dep-exists</a> 在共同基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 上的实例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 取集合族的理解结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 取幂集谓词纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A\">\\(\\pi_A\\)</span> 属于该理解显示类。原稿的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Omega\">\\(P:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 没有约束 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 或真值解释；现以明确的子集谓词展开，不把任意高阶命题对象当成宿主布尔真值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-existential-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"1f2931643da418a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-existential-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-exists","status":"resolved","id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-exists]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$ 为 [[16-df-set]] 的宇宙，$\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U$，$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族。$\\Gamma.A$、$\\pi_A$ 由下文构造，$P\\subseteq\\Gamma.A$、$Q\\subseteq\\Gamma$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-existential-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"1f2931643da418a6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"各幂集取包含序，$\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}:\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.A)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Gamma)$ 是 [[16-df-existential-quantifier]] 沿下文投影的直接像；$\\pi_A^*$ 是其逆像。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dep-exists","status":"resolved","id":"3ae97efa23f80edf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是 [[16-df-dep-exists]] 在共同基底 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 上的实例：$p$ 取集合族的理解结构，$q$ 取幂集谓词纤维化，$\\pi_A$ 属于该理解显示类。原稿的 $P:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Omega$ 没有约束 $\\Omega$ 或真值解释；现以明确的子集谓词展开，不把任意高阶命题对象当成宿主布尔真值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_A","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}:\\mathcal P(\\Gamma.A)\\to\\mathcal P(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_A^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma.A&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\mid\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\land a\\in A(\\gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\pi_A&\\coloneqq((\\gamma,a)\\mapsto\\gamma):\\Gamma.A\\to\\Gamma,\\\\\n\\pi_A^*(Q)&\\coloneqq\\{(\\gamma,a)\\in\\Gamma.A\\mid\\gamma\\in Q\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}(P)&=\\{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma\\mid(\\exists a\\in A(\\gamma))\\ (\\gamma,a)\\in P\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}(P)\\subseteq Q&\\Longleftrightarrow P\\subseteq\\pi_A^*(Q),\\\\\n\\Sigma_{\\pi_A}&\\dashv\\pi_A^*.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma,a)\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\pi_A^{-1}[Q]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_A","display":false},{"tex":"P:\\Gamma.A\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false}],"bytes":1847,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dep-exists-11|df-dependent-exists-set-model]]"}],"outgoing":["09b2ae01fb2d54e3","1f2931643da418a6","3ae97efa23f80edf"]}